// An orc, drawn on the humanoid rig (the player's parts and poses, crates/art):
// green skin, a topknot, a heavy brow, red eyes, a tusk; leather and bone.
// Facing right; the game mirrors it.
(
    size: (44, 46),
    feet: (21.5, 46),
    outline: (26, 20, 20),
